  <item>
    <title>李秀满的回光返照：A2O LITE 把二代遗老炸出来了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ae0a9e8c96c8942ec132ed4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ae0a9e8c96c8942ec132ed4</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>已经退休的二代遗老桑尼，刷到 A2O LITE 后决定重返韩娱圈，于是请出常驻韩娱的学姐做导游。</span><br><span>从李秀满离开 SM、竞业三年后另起炉灶，到发布会上听不懂的高斯泼溅和 AI 分身，我们决定：概念 who cares，只看脸和舞台。</span><br><br><br><span>录制：桑尼、学姐</span><br><span>剪辑：学姐</span><br><span>shownote：AI</span><br><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10">00:10</a> 开场：二代遗老桑尼限时重返韩娱圈</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="167">02:47</a> A2O 是什么：阿尔法 to 欧米伽，李秀满离开 SM 另起炉灶</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="327">05:27</a> 世界观速通：AI 分身，和听不懂的高斯泼溅</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="569">09:29</a> 出道曲《NEON》：不到两天拿下日冠，编舞无敌的老派 K-pop</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="781">13:01</a> 九人女团初印象：大型女团回来了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="913">15:13</a> 认人：主舞 AIJING（盛艾敬）、像杨幂的 OA、像邓恩熙的 AYUNE</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1221">20:21</a> 中国成员 MERCI（马西桐）、XILI（梁淅沥），开场双人舞容易被拉踩</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1391">23:11</a> 出道即被扒：AIJING 父母欠薪风波，各人道德水位不一样</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 延伸：替父母还债的人，和不能晒奢靡的明星</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2085">34:45</a> 「LITE」与六代女团：ILLIT、KiiiKiii、MEOVV、BABYMONSTER</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2415">40:15</a> 小公司逆袭：RESCENE，和一个涩谷辣妹手势</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2643">44:03</a> 学姐安利：刷舞台和舞蹈接力，双人舞编舞是 J Black</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2914">48:34</a> 同期男团 A2O SOUL：男团包容度为什么这么高</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3283">54:43</a> A2O 宇宙里的中国人含量，不负责任地买股 OA 和 AIJING</span><br><br><br><span>ED：《NEON》 by A2O LITE</span><br><br><br><span>节目里说先看一遍舞台再认人，链接放这儿：</span><br><span>- MV 认人版：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1v2pC6gEMd" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1v2pC6gEMd"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a><br><span>- 出道舞台：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HUp96UEHN" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1HUp96UEHN"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a><br><span>- 编舞 reaction：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gkpq6UEjb" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1gkpq6UEjb"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a><br><span>- 编曲 reaction：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pmWA63Ex2" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pmWA63Ex2"><span>www.bilibili.com</span></a><br><span>​</span></p>]]></description>
