  <item>
    <title>当娱乐圈文照进现实：《我的女友是景甜》</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a96dadbf03e74ee6b036d97</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a96dadbf03e74ee6b036d97</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>紧急开录吃个热乎瓜，从孙宇晨×景甜聊到整个娱乐圈的恋爱套路，最后试图回答一个终极问题：为什么小说里磕得津津有味，放到现实就觉得膈应？</span></p><p><span>录制：七仔、桑尼、学姐、CK</span></p><p><span>剪辑：学姐</span></p><p><span>shownote：AI</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5">00:05</a> 紧急开录吃热乎瓜</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="30">00:30</a> 各自今天的吃瓜心路历程</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="914">15:14</a> 回顾景甜的三段恋情</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1239">20:39</a> 景甜×张继科那段有声有色的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a> 第三段来了：币圈大佬孙宇晨</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1948">32:28</a> 拆解娱乐圈情侣的经典套路分类</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2984">49:44</a> 聊到郑爽发现她也是三段式剧本</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3215">53:35</a> 上价值：为什么小说可以现实不行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3620">01:00:20</a> 金句时刻：网文的钱是没有声音的</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3651">01:00:51</a> 每人选一对不会让你膈应的真实CP</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3813">01:03:33</a> 希望娱乐圈文少一地鸡毛</span></p><p><span>ED：《现实开始算帐》（AI 歌曲）</span></p>]]></description>
