    <title>《披荆斩棘2026》名单锐评：谁是黑马，谁最体寒</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a83ec345aeb2a5712e88963</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a83ec345aeb2a5712e88963</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 18 Aug 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>《披荆斩棘2026》首期直播当晚，四位主播拿着28位哥哥名单，按年龄顺序做一轮未看舞台前的刻板印象锐评。从“去父留子”、周杰伦挂件，到院人、短剧和选秀熟人宇宙，年龄层不同带来的认人大战和离谱爆料一路失控。</span></p><p><span>最后大家为潜在黑马买股，并实时翻微博看看谁抢到开播第一波热搜——如果节目爆了，本期可能当场作废。</span></p><p><span>录制：七仔、桑尼、学姐、CK</span></p><p><span>剪辑：学姐</span></p><p><span>shownote：学姐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3">00:03</a> 28位哥哥名单与赛前锐评规则</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 邵兵退赛，“去父留子”开场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 孙楠：绕不开的《歌手》退赛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="525">08:45</a> 刘畊宏：健身教练与周杰伦挂件</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="756">12:36</a> 满江登场，代际认人测试开始</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="964">16:04</a> 郭晓冬、李光洁的演员记忆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1373">22:53</a> 小沈阳、余文乐与彩铃歌手欢子</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1677">27:57</a> 王传君、张睿、曹骏三连评</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1964">32:44</a> 王啸坤、阿云嘎与选秀往事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">36:55</a> 年轻演员和歌手的“体寒”之争</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2544">42:24</a> 唐九洲院人宇宙与短剧顶流曾辉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2768">46:08</a> 姚琛、米卡的国际身份大讨论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3050">50:50</a> 邵子恒压轴，父子话题回收</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3170">52:50</a> 四位主播正式买股押黑马</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3418">56:58</a> 现场翻热搜，谁抢到第一波镜头</span></p><p></p><p><span>ED: Where Do We Go! by Ayumu Imazu</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
